{"id":"vod_hh_70949","vodId":"70949","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达00","name_cn":"机动战士高达00","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第25集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/516561ecb4b9accfb3e240247b7715ac.jpg"},"summary":"公元2307年，地球的化石燃料枯竭了。经过将近半个世纪的建设后，建成了全长5万千米、以3条轨道升降机为中心的太阳能发电系统。为了建造出这个能制造半永久能量的巨大建筑物，世界形成了3个巨大的国家联盟：以美国为中心的“世界经济联盟”，通称UNION；以中国、俄罗斯、印度为中心的“人类革新联盟”；新欧洲共同体AEU。由于轨道升降机过于巨大，防卫变成了十分困难的任务。但各国军队依然为了自己的威信与繁荣进行着大规模的zero-sum game（任何一方都得不到好处的竞争）。这样的世界，要为其花上句号的组织出现了——拥有机动战士高达的“天人”私人武装组织。他们为了消除世界的纷争，展开了超越民族、国家、宗教的作战行动。高达驾驶员刹那•F•清英决心改变这个世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-06-11 11:30:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAYOZBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQ8LM7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZ9X1vd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7axg9OEe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKVEDre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6AVQ7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej9J1Wd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerl7Dwb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel96wla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepjV11b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Le3NjkMd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4yKB2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen9J34d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddwqg3Ja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0r3x7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8DY55b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集"